# v35 OVERLAY (user 2026-11-02: "train agent - lane following and apply goal
# condition reward at junctions - also resample goals until the agent covers
# 200m"; choices: route progress in junction zones, new goal past the next
# junction on each arrival, from scratch, goal mode only, v34's GPU slot).
#
# WHY. The v30 map arms showed the driver, not navigation, caps long routes:
# mapless v30 faults ~3 times per 100 m whatever the goal distance. So goal
# mode is paid what keeps a car on the road -- LANE FOLLOWING (forward progress
# along the lane, the v52 fines) -- everywhere, and the goal decides only what
# it should decide: which way to go at a junction. Inside the junction zone
# (in a junction, or within GOAL_ZONE_M of one) the forward progress is
# REPLACED by route progress toward the goal, retreat charged at v30's 0.3.
# Goals are chained (soft reset, same car) so one start drives up to 200 m
# through several junctions, each goal its own replay episode.
#
# Everything else is v30's recipe (encoder, observation, action box, HER,
# junction-goal ramp for the first goal, 5-25 m first goals).
. "$REPO/slurm/v30_overlay.env"

# Lane following in goal mode: explore's forward progress is paid again
# (v26 had removed it with GOAL_ROUTE_ONLY=1), except inside the zone.
export GOAL_ROUTE_ONLY=0
export GOAL_ZONE_M=10

# Chained goals, training envs only: on arrival with < 200 m driven in the
# chain, the next goal is drawn 10-30 m past the next junction ahead (within
# 60 m; else 10-30 m along the road). A fault or the clock ends the chain.
export GOAL_CHAIN_M=200 GOAL_CHAIN_MIN_M=10 GOAL_CHAIN_MAX_M=30 GOAL_CHAIN_LOOKAHEAD_M=60
# The env no longer moves the goal on a too-fast pass through the radius (it
# moved the planner's goal away from the latched goal image).
export GOAL_KEEP_ON_PASS=1

# Goal mode only.
export EXPLORE_PROB=0

# A leg can now pay up to ~90 m of lane progress + 100 arrival.
export TQC_VALUE_CEILING=300

# v30's LAUNCH settings, which v30/v34 passed on the command line (v35's first
# launch, job 462867, ran without them and was stopped at minute 6): HER, a 1M
# row uint8 replay on the CPU, 15% noise-free episodes, a video every 20th.
export HER=1 REPLAY_CAPACITY=1000000 REPLAY_DEVICE=cpu REPLAY_U8=1
export DET_EPISODE_FRAC=0.15 VIDEO_EVERY=20
